    "text": "The land specified morefully in the Order No. 172 of 2018 dated02.08.2018 made under the Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the LandAcquisition Act (Chapter 460) and published in the GazetteExtra Ordinary No. 2082/61 dated 03.08.2018 was vested in theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. But the possession ofthe land described below has not yet been taken for and on behalf ofthe Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. Therefore, I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms, byvirtue of powers vested in me under Section 39 (1) of the LandAcquisition Act, do hereby revoke the Order made in respect of thelands sepcified morefully in the Schedule below, under the aforesaidvesting Order No. 172 of 2018 dated 02.08.2018 published in theGazette Extra Ordinary No. 2082/61 dated 03.08.2018.",
